== Effects ==
* Taking damage summons a bird [[familiar]] that chases enemies for the remainder of the current [[Rooms|room]], dealing 2 damage per tick (~4.3 damage per second).
** {{dlc|r+}} As long as Isaac's HP is at one half heart ( no matter the type of heart), '''Dead Bird''' will remain active between rooms. Upon entering a new floor, '''Dead Bird''' will be inactive, and a hit must be taken to activate it again.

== Notes ==
* {{C|Eve}} starts with this item by default.
** {{dlc|r+}} Additionally, Dead Bird will remain active between rooms at a total HP of one heart or less.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Birthright}} + {{C|Eve}}: Dead Bird will be active at all times.
* {{dlc+|r+}}{{C|The Lost}} / {{C|Tainted Lost}}: Dead Bird is active at all times.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Box of Friends}}: Does not double Dead Bird, even if Isaac has taken damage before use.
* {{I|Sacrificial Altar}}: The familiar can only be sacrificed while it is active.

