== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Darkness Falls}}.
* This item is a reference to an old series of comics Edmund McMillen drew called [https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/194056 Thicker Than Water], where the Dead Bird is said to represent his inner doubts and self-destructive nature.

